# @vbcdx/dsh-config-editor-plugin — configuration template
#
# The editor reads and writes the DSH state directory: settings.yaml,
# reverse-proxy.json, .credentials.yaml, and the agent preset compositions
# (.agent-presets/<id>/agent.cordis.yml). It uses the default state
# directory (~/.dsh) unless DSH_HOME points somewhere else — set it here
# (or in your environment) only when your DSH installation uses a custom
# home.
#
# This file contains placeholders only — never commit real credentials.

# Optional: DSH state directory (default: ~/.dsh)
# DSH_HOME = /path/to/your/dsh-home
